<h2>GET /users</h2>

<p>Returns a list of users.</p>

<h3>Example Request</h3>

<pre>
<code>
GET /users
</code>
</pre>

<h3>Example Response</h3>

<pre>
<code>
{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Alex"
}
</code>
</pre>

<hr>

<h2>POST /users</h2>

<p>Creates a new user.</p>

<h3>Example Request</h3>

<pre>
<code>
POST /users

{
    "name": "Alex"
}
</code>
</pre>

